
LiveStage appliance (Alpine Linux)

  rc-service livestage restart | stop | start   the mixer
  tail -f /var/log/livestage.log                its log
  livestage-server --list-devices               audio interfaces
  aplay -l                                      ALSA cards

  Settings:      /data/livestage/livestage.conf  (see /etc/conf.d/livestage)
  Session:       /data/livestage/show.json
  Recordings:    /data/livestage/recordings

  The system is read-only. To change it: mount -o remount,rw /
  Set a root password first thing: passwd (with / mounted read-write)

